#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0895 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable with a prefix of CRIT, a suffix of FL and containing either a one-digit or two-digit number (CRITyFL) is present and a variable with the same root without a suffix of FL (CRITy) is not present
#note "CRIT1FL present, CRIT1 absent -> violation"
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt nameOnly=CRIT1FL
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col CRIT1FL type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | Y
---
